#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:5
#: 345c7e86e32e449085e30b3fe5126737 8a7ccc263ce3424c8cb91bf6b6aaed74
#: 9efed730a0c74c9792c58541ee514975 b1bb78de288744f98df4ed2dd84f3ede
#: ff40740d88a5408a9683b5e1d793eb6a
msgid "Powering the Pixhawk"
msgstr "为 Pixhawk 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:7
#: 2373a16d57584176b8393eb33a800f50 3f6b197eb3c042b5a3d3fa86bb7acbae
#: 59c8afd60f194f31a56099ef069da509 91acfa820e83408f9111410349c9acb7
#: fd28ce3dcd394d15978a95f277869874
msgid ""
"This article explains how to power the :ref:`Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-"
"overview>`."
msgstr "本文介绍如何为 :ref:`Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-overview>` 供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:11
#: 61277ea324534f41a29967d247cdc34c 6776648fcd4f4011bf2a95b446d965ec
#: 9d408e4573e443bdab4357642501037d bbfb39b7be13474d88159b4591adf583
#: ceadd7d29cdb4665b09a7f77fa1faf80
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:13
#: 0189fcdc7d0c4511b6e33c20c49b24e3 137ae8dd8b3a4f4b9110a48b148682b7
#: 8f741920906c4e54a49adb84b22efa4b a314ce21654043009d553a805cbc9004
#: d629a5d096ae43e0836c21ee3925ad49
msgid ""
"For most users powering the Pixhawk is as simple as connecting a 6-pin DF13 "
"cable from one of the :ref:`supported power modules <common-powermodule-"
"landingpage>` into the Pixhawk's \"Power\" port as shown below."
msgstr ""
"对于大多数用户而言，为 Pixhawk 供电只需将一根 6 针 DF13 线缆从 :ref:`支持的电源模块 <common-powermodule-"
"landingpage>` 连接到 Pixhawk 的「Power」端口，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:20
#: 181508657f28497880569856300e318d 637e511ba7084d7bbd8253c20eef30f0
#: 6ccb245870914a9d8960789c11bf4f42 d4fd7b80f8c74c1184c6658bd029cb1c
#: f550d0c161bb43e7a12541d279612e76
msgid "Pixhawk Power Port"
msgstr "Pixhawk 电源端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:22
#: 01a3ac4e96e14af1b28923c8a5c7bb32 09860da31ab44813a8d70c213b28b087
#: 46e81b6a07034393a99dc3344974fc72 709458a5bdb74d66a880c8fd462f6e4d
#: 994e311e03e346dfbc33a95435274d64
msgid ""
"The module will provide a steady ~5V to Pixhawk and allow the Pixhawk to "
"measure the current and/or voltage of the main battery. Depending on the "
"power module you may also have connections to provide backup power and power"
" to supply the servo rail."
msgstr ""
"该模块将为 Pixhawk 稳定提供约 5V 电源，并允许 Pixhawk "
"测量主电池的电流和/或电压。根据所用电源模块，您还可能有连接用于提供备用电源和舵机排供电的接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:27
#: 484657a9016d4c1b930f2d8e54f4d925 61aca585d4e041c0a0cc5ea0df33358a
#: d890f8e5ea764cd1bca94c1a749015bd e4e5a9fa24df4df4914942c457f8810c
#: fd6ec3e855b145338cf090a0d0da38e9
msgid ""
"The type of power module also determines what size batteries can be used "
"(most multicopters draw less than 20amps when hovering and rarely consume "
"more than 90amps at full throttle)."
msgstr "电源模块的类型也决定了可使用的电池尺寸（大多数多旋翼悬停时耗电不超过 20A，满油门时极少超过 90A）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:33
#: 26ea70ca704b47aba3a8955387089400 a03cffe8c7c1451e98e21b38553384f0
#: cafa5c860f61497aa7761176a4559928 d52a7eb8d3aa4b37bd334831d17a2429
#: dd6e0d08a30041a2a1905d9edb74deb0
msgid ""
"Pixhawk does **not** *supply* power to the servo rail. Powering the servo "
"rails is normally done by an ESC or alternatively a separate source such as "
"a BEC (as shown in the :ref:`wiring overview below <common-powering-the-"
"pixhawk_pixhawk_poweresc_wiring_overview>`)."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk **不会** 向舵机排 *供电*。舵机排供电通常由 ESC 完成，或通过独立电源（如 BEC）实现（如 :ref:`下方接线概览 "
"<common-powering-the-pixhawk_pixhawk_poweresc_wiring_overview>` 所示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:40
#: 1340db1e71504e939786e7a2c715b52d 7e5e251d8e7b47dfaef36e9b62c732d1
#: a8eb8008d4f3473eafa2935e53193e0c cd8655028b99469c9b2a39aa6ce857b3
#: dac3a1d7ad6b4082a0de096bf205b3d3
msgid ""
"Some power modules explicitly provide support for powering the servo rail, "
"backup power and support for larger batteries. Using this sort of module "
"means that you don't need to think about most of the wiring issues discussed"
" in the rest of this article."
msgstr "某些电源模块明确支持为舵机排供电、提供备用电源以及支持更大容量的电池。使用此类模块意味着您无需考虑本文其余部分讨论的大多数接线问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:47
#: 0115164f487c4e5caa9239bf4b902002 191cd9a2d78d465996bb78fa66969ed3
#: 4ed60cdd6c074d1798c2665761e573c6 585b1be032494355a9d8a286f8fcbf17
#: e5871688e2ba4654bf706ca8bd8ffbce
msgid ""
"Pixhawk supplies power for an RC receiver if that receiver is connected via "
"a 3-conductor servo cable to the RC connector on the Pixhawk. If that "
"receiver is also connected to the SBus port on the Pixhawk to communicate an"
" analog RSSI signal via a 3-conductor cable, there is an opportunity to "
"inadvertently power the servo bus from the primary PixHawk power input thru "
"the radio."
msgstr ""
"如果接收机通过 3 芯舵机线缆连接到 Pixhawk 的 RC 连接器，Pixhawk 将为该接收机供电。若该接收机同时通过 3 芯线缆连接到 "
"Pixhawk 的 SBus 端口以传输模拟 RSSI 信号，则可能意外地通过无线电将 Pixhawk 主供电输入的电源反向馈入舵机总线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:50
#: 3d68c501c0984a83a349dec5820adee4 5abb2cc68b42411590e642ffa0511577
#: 8b357a773ffc41d3a1dc46a1f1e44aa5 ca54e6e8295743f9afa9a0978b30b44b
#: f9673976c2e44c67aff5be77df830803
msgid ""
"Some radios (e.g., FRSky) will pass power received on their RC output cable "
"out on their analog RSSI port. And the PixHawk servo-rail power bus includes"
" the SBus +5v pin."
msgstr ""
"某些无线电（例如 FRSky）会将从 RC 输出线缆接收到的电源输出到其模拟 RSSI 端口。而 Pixhawk 舵机排电源总线包含 SBus 的 "
"+5V 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:52
#: 0369399eccad451f810950206c8f7cf9 5b9ecfcc7a70429fbd8373c9debeafab
#: 6ec2e409b31149f4bdeb328b38ea2e48 b548e648d1d6453482fb6f4ca29691bd
#: d47f38feb99f4a39b89bc99482d85a43
msgid ""
"Removing the center conductor from the RSSI monitoring cable will avoid "
"powering the Pixhawk servo bus from the wrong (or from multiple) voltage "
"sources thru the RC radio receiver."
msgstr "从 RSSI 监控线缆中取出中间导线，可避免通过 RC 接收机从错误（或多路）电压源为 Pixhawk 舵机总线供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:55
#: 14f5291627c14b5f94a7d391835d2b3f 70062ea433224366b76f784a03fa887f
#: 7b70a680f49a4d8ea7cd18433932871a abd4d094dcf047288ae38482a6430855
#: d2ab8d4a0e0d4e9d9b598a7bb20568b0
msgid "Powering/backup off the servo rail"
msgstr "通过舵机排供电/备用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:57
#: 2b4fe786afb7414f8198627aa26a5ab2 41960842cd9a4635897bc0d5934792a4
#: 87caa7d3778e4419b7b28ae69cbef040 919cf70a9d6d49ef852d7cceea8730bc
#: ed2f1c6a15884537b929fabd023a7188
msgid ""
"Pixhawk can be powered off the servo rail instead of from a power module. "
"This is achieved by connecting a 5V BEC (with or without a servo) to a power"
" (+) pin and a ground (-) pin of the \"MAIN OUT\" or \"AUX OUT\" pins. You "
"**must** also add a Zener diode (part number 1N5339) to condition the power "
"across the rail and restrict it to less than 5.7V."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 可通过舵机排而非电源模块供电。方法是将 5V BEC（带或不带舵机）连接到「MAIN OUT」或「AUX "
"OUT」引脚中的一个电源（+）引脚和地（-）引脚。您 **还必须** 添加一个稳压二极管（型号 1N5339）以稳定排上的电压，将其限制在 5.7V "
"以下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:70
#: 152d320dea874e25a045b8bf5be1dfbf 1835d137ec4d4c638b170fcb7bcdef85
#: 92e726bc06f741458fe80f4ff2601a01 b51646b329cb40a0b0b8a9973c7a0c6f
#: ccf6a9061d0245d38125594c85542aa9
msgid ""
"This method can also be used as backup power for Pixhawk when using a power "
"module. If the voltage provided by the power module falls too low (4V?), "
"Pixhawk will take power from the output rail. See the *voltage ratings* "
"section below for more information on powering Pixhawk."
msgstr ""
"使用电源模块时，此方法也可用作 Pixhawk 的备用电源。若电源模块提供的电压过低（4V？），Pixhawk 将从输出排取电。有关 Pixhawk "
"供电的更多信息，请参阅下方的 *电压规格* 部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:77
#: 1c68b000adab4d6a8816e99cc2d322e2 39aecc1f4aad490ebd7abcc6cf922e6a
#: 508efb61ae6544e7be973b0e4e3abe7a 7c4a25ab19764df38830d7584a9fc8f8
#: 8ce4dda3ebc54256ae730fe52d8badd0
msgid ""
"The servo rail can supply servos requiring up to 10.5V (but not also power "
"the Pixhawk). Voltages above 5V cannot be used to power the Pixhawk via the "
"servo rail. In this case the Zener diode **must not be used**."
msgstr ""
"舵机排可为需要最高 10.5V 的舵机供电（但不能同时为 Pixhawk 供电）。5V 以上的电压不能通过舵机排为 Pixhawk 供电，此时 "
"**不得使用** 稳压二极管。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:83
#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:97
#: 0bb451d9ce5c49daaf19cb6cb10148c3 46b34ca2abbb45f1a244a1a4520c4236
#: 60065abc99a247c6a6ec97958f9c5ddf 6f603c489caa4e5481056d046bd20213
#: 7ec261402fdd416f8f805ba7b0f3af82 86131463f4a5416a9d6df2c0c65a54d3
#: 9a125fff6ca147fa882220e4abf4ef47 c024b0e695474681aedc91f34152b584
#: c6bc440c2f2d4930a9620abf722fe522 cb59c16e3fef49fb912700a1b7cf8be9
msgid "Pixhawk Power/ESC Wiring Overview"
msgstr "Pixhawk 电源/ESC 接线概览"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:85
#: 38c84b4fdce2495c93cf452b322b5def 3af15b93948e4490a18a13ded32a1a3b
#: 4105c9df9ea04c9683f6f9b1188a25b0 7ff747f2e0634056ac9f3dc7936e90c1
#: d762e9b02f3d42898127abc9917f86ab
msgid ""
"The block diagram below synthesizes an overview of Pixhawk's power and ESC "
"wiring. In this diagram, a 3DR power module (or equivalent device) powers "
"Pixhawk through its power port (primary source). One power source is enough "
"but obviously not redundant if the power module fails to power this primary "
"source. Therefore the diagram adds a second backup power source via a 5V BEC"
" that wires to Pixhawk's output servo rail. If the primary source fails, "
"Pixhawk will automatically switch to this second power source."
msgstr ""
"下方框图综合展示了 Pixhawk 的电源和 ESC 接线概览。图中，3DR 电源模块（或同等设备）通过电源端口（主供电）为 Pixhawk "
"供电。一路电源已足够，但若主供电失效则不具备冗余。因此，该图还添加了通过 5V BEC 连接到 Pixhawk "
"输出舵机排的第二路备用电源。若主供电失效，Pixhawk 将自动切换到第二路电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:99
#: 28290dfd80c24536af18f773858a343e 5f51923eb9364c2cbc9a886aa78f9267
#: d11fa83f614045fdbcf50ea3be3d84f0 e23aaaec11ea4a4fa22dd43aa8a069be
#: fa098d9fef9c456da55d7b92d2c3d447
msgid "*Diagram acronyms:*"
msgstr "*图中缩写：*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:101
#: 1218eea325694a92aa57283e6fca2ffb 2a332c5cd8e0461da59c33bf48882e06
#: 547b5c21c7214056b79d68f549835128 928e784c64224a8c83d0811ee1c9b213
#: 975135e6cca04fbfb67638ea53b31741
msgid "*PDB = Power Distribution Board.*"
msgstr "*PDB = 电源分配板。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:102
#: a464c30c4c08468193375dda56ba8b16 a9b5131349cb40ff91128eb6da08be14
#: d0c782a1296b46e3a4d27b98f288f7b4 d26802663cc24f408294d5645827b0bc
#: e6675c7b7938416eb8b2455a2e5a68cc
msgid "*PM = pixhawk power port.*"
msgstr "*PM = Pixhawk 电源端口。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:103
#: 0a9e22ed0b8942aeb3f56bc6fb6005e8 344098c4c4274dc8ab3c8f12f67b0446
#: 55c97aad39b541d48603e4d4b8d1ea7a ae616e5c13874ea5a7713ad5841ea7b4
#: f6b5b642da484ed78b791ffeff90f6f3
msgid ""
"*PM/Atto = optional power module from 3DR or Attopilot alternative for "
"higher than 4S battery voltages.*"
msgstr "*PM/Atto = 可选的 3DR 或 Attopilot 电源模块，用于高于 4S 电池电压的情况。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:108
#: 4891f21d1c114341ab7ce181d94177eb
msgid ""
"Looking for a detailed explanation of power wiring with Pixhawk? `Click here"
" for more information about connecting ESCs and servos to Pixhawk. "
"<http://pixhawk.org/users/actuators/pwm_escs_and_servos>`__\\"
msgstr ""
"需要 Pixhawk 供电接线的详细说明？`点击此处获取有关将 ESC 和舵机连接到 Pixhawk 的更多信息。 "
"<http://pixhawk.org/users/actuators/pwm_escs_and_servos>`__\\"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:112
#: 479d502e9fdf4120a9fa125b54b23b98 7350ce73546b474a9ff67529b899b22a
#: 86959f3027a141d2a4d8383ba914f491 8eeaa6389d924918931c06566314341e
#: b75d2a65421d46638bb7c482ac821005
msgid "General wiring recommendations"
msgstr "通用接线建议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:114
#: 0b0ae195f8654152a3d92b35630e9734 319fe4faf88b404a88d80c713ecb0231
#: 42b79cd24ab344e5ad6bd88cdc579ee6 9c27baf6b9da45ceaeaa4e6d495ff2a1
#: fc1dacd4dac445af949581d3c1577f6b
msgid ""
"Always connect a ground reference wire with your ESC's signal wires on the "
"Pixhawk servo rail (output ports 1-8). Indeed an ESC's signal wire should "
"never be left floating without its ground reference (THERE IS NO SETUP WHICH"
" WOULDN'T REQUIRE SIGNAL GROUND TO BE CONNECTED)."
msgstr ""
"在 Pixhawk 舵机排（输出端口 1–8）上，始终将地线与 ESC 信号线一起连接。ESC "
"的信号线绝对不能在没有地线参考的情况下悬空（没有任何配置不需要连接信号地）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:119
#: 0fe3614004ab42afaf838f198b308fd1 306918f9d83f47139393528dd9ef9c2a
#: 4e324c222d0947778bf3e492b15de56e f386946369c44740a1d43fa4a5c19e4d
#: fb1961c5c84d42a6a5698f54475ca58a
msgid ""
"It is dangerous to power the Pixhawk **only** from the servo rail, "
"especially with digital servos. Servos may cause voltage spikes (as shown on"
" illustration below that shows the servo rail voltage on an oscilloscope "
"when a single digital servo attached to a Pixhawk is moved rapidly ). The "
"key thing is that the digital servo causes the voltage on the rail to rise "
"above the critical 5.7V level. Above that level the Pixhawk power management"
" will cut power to the FMU and the Pixhawk will reboot. **If that happens "
"when flying you will lose your aircraft.**"
msgstr ""
"**仅** 通过舵机排为 Pixhawk 供电存在危险，尤其是使用数字舵机时。舵机可能引起电压尖峰（如下方示波器图所示，图中显示了快速移动连接到 "
"Pixhawk 的单个数字舵机时舵机排的电压波形）。关键问题在于，数字舵机会使排上电压升至临界 5.7V 以上。超过该电压，Pixhawk "
"电源管理将切断 FMU 的电源，Pixhawk 将重启。**若在飞行中发生此情况，您将损失飞行器。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:132
#: 6f3659cdd6384f189e15c3f1fe4c20a9 71b8c4b2c70c4a919dd0b110584cc3d7
#: 79db507c4a5a4931911af42260265580 d33741fc8e824c86a58ebc020928ea5a
#: d4fad49bd00a46e2a8783b57fd243666
msgid ""
"It is up to the user to provide a clean source of power for the cases when "
"it is powered off the servo rail. Servos by themselves are not quiet enough."
msgstr "当通过舵机排供电时，用户需自行确保电源干净。单独的舵机本身噪声不够小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:136
#: 10935067d16545c9b7a069efe94dbd0d 2303b4447e4648f08644008e7966f733
#: 99c2df964a144f79b89406e438dca803 d37884c5d3dc4ebeb270896e39ea6c2f
#: f082ee9c3d724fd99ffc7e88fb4e4487
msgid ""
"Do not connect a BEC power source to the RC IN port (black ground, red power"
" and white signal wires from the receiver's PPM output are connected to "
"these RC pins)"
msgstr "不要将 BEC 电源连接到 RC IN 端口（接收机 PPM 输出的黑色地线、红色电源线和白色信号线应连接到这些 RC 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-pixhawk.rst:139
#: 17e695a1872c45de909dac8a2092c21b 412e003381b446318b3f4e08f9da15cd
#: 49b878c5d5524e4fb56bfcecdbd2dff4 4f3c29c9fa2c42dfbb8aacfe13c7f355
#: db79b4ee275b429998cb6d1d078698b6
msgid ""
"Adding an external Zener is a recommendation specifically for systems that "
"are using 5V servos and have the servo rail configured for back up power. "
"Connect the recommended Zener diode with its polarity as indicated on the "
"diagram. Use as short wires as possible or even better, use a standard 3 "
"position JR servo connector with the diode legs directly inserted (and "
"soldered) in the servo female pins. To complement the diode, it is also "
"useful to add a capacitor in parallel to the diode. The capacitor will "
"smooth out eventual voltage ripples. As advised for the diode, the capacitor"
" should be connected with as short wires as possible. Do not oversize the "
"capacitor."
msgstr ""
"添加外接稳压二极管是针对使用 5V 舵机且舵机排配置为备用电源的系统的建议。按图示极性连接推荐的稳压二极管。尽量使用最短的连线，或更好地，使用标准 3 "
"针 JR "
"舵机连接器，将二极管引脚直接插入（并焊接到）舵机母引脚中。除二极管外，并联一个电容也很有用，电容可平滑可能出现的电压波纹。与二极管一样，电容的连线也应尽可能短。不要使用过大的电容。"

